---
import Home from '@/layouts/Home'

const rssUrl = '/rss.xml'
const siteUrl = 'https://cgmoke.github.io'
---

<Home title="订阅中心">
  <div class="text-sm mb-8" data-pagefind-ignore>
    <section id="subscribe-rss" class="mb-8 scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="section-title defaultColor"><span>📡</span> RSS 订阅</h2>
      <div class="surface-card p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
          通过 RSS 订阅，你可以第一时间获取博客的最新文章更新。使用你喜欢的 RSS 阅读器，添加下方的订阅链接即可。
        </p>
        <div class="bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 break-all">{siteUrl}{rssUrl}</code>
            <button
              id="copyRssBtn"
              class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors flex-shrink-0"
            >
              复制链接
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a
            href={`feed:${siteUrl}${rssUrl}`}
            class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-100 to-red-100 dark:from-orange-900/30 dark:to-red-900/30 hover:from-orange-200 hover:to-red-200 dark:hover:from-orange-900/50 dark:hover:to-red-900/50 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">📰</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-sm">RSS 阅读器</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">点击使用默认阅读器订阅</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a
            href={rssUrl}
            target="_blank"
            class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-100 to-pink-100 dark:from-purple-900/30 dark:to-pink-900/30 hover:from-purple-200 hover:to-pink-200 dark:hover:from-purple-900/50 dark:hover:to-pink-900/50 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">🔗</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-sm">直接查看 XML</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">在新窗口打开源文件</div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="subscribe-column" class="mb-8 scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="section-title defaultColor"><span>🤖</span> ROS2 技术专栏</h2>
      <div class="surface-card p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
          专注于机器人操作系统 ROS2 的学习笔记、教程和实战经验分享。涵盖 ROS2 基础概念、通信机制、导航栈、MoveIt2 等内容。
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-500">ROS2</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">核心概念</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-500">Nav2</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">导航栈</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-500">MoveIt</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">机械臂</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-500">Gazebo</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">仿真环境</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/coding"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 text-white rounded-lg text-sm hover:from-blue-600 hover:to-purple-600 transition-all"
        >
          浏览 ROS2 相关文章 →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="subscribe-what-is-rss" class="mb-8 scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="section-title defaultColor"><span>💡</span> 什么是 RSS？</h2>
      <div class="surface-card p-6">
        <div class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <p>
            <strong>RSS</strong>（Really Simple Syndication）是一种描述和同步网站内容的格式，它可以让你无需访问网站就能获取最新更新。
          </p>
          <p><strong>推荐的 RSS 阅读器：</strong></p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Feedly</strong> - 跨平台，界面美观，免费版足够日常使用</li>
            <li><strong>Inoreader</strong> - 功能强大，支持规则过滤</li>
            <li><strong>NetNewsWire</strong> - macOS/iOS 原生体验，开源免费</li>
            <li><strong>Reeder</strong> - Apple 生态首选，设计优雅</li>
            <li><strong>浏览器插件</strong> - RSS Feed Reader 等 Chrome/Firefox 扩展</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="subscribe-contact" class="mb-8 scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="section-title defaultColor"><span>📬</span> 其他联系方式</h2>
      <div class="surface-card p-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/CGmoke"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 hover:bg-white/70 dark:hover:bg-black/50 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">🐙</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-sm defaultColor">GitHub</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">@CGmoke</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/aboutme"
            class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/50 dark:bg-black/30 hover:bg-white/70 dark:hover:bg-black/50 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">👤</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-sm defaultColor">关于我</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">了解更多</div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div slot="catalogue">
    <div class="anchor catalogue sm:px-10 lg:mt-28 lg:inline-block desktop">
      <div class="title font-bold text-md"># 目录导航</div>
      <a href="#subscribe-rss" class="category-button rounded-lg mt-2 text-md block py-1 hover:bg-slate-400">
        「 RSS 订阅 」
      </a>
      <a href="#subscribe-column" class="category-button rounded-lg mt-2 text-md block py-1 hover:bg-slate-400">
        「 ROS2 专栏 」
      </a>
      <a href="#subscribe-what-is-rss" class="category-button rounded-lg mt-2 text-md block py-1 hover:bg-slate-400">
        「 什么是 RSS 」
      </a>
      <a href="#subscribe-contact" class="category-button rounded-lg mt-2 text-md block py-1 hover:bg-slate-400">
        「 联系方式 」
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Home>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyRssBtn')
    if (copyBtn) {
      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const rssUrl = `${window.location.origin}/rss.xml`
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(rssUrl)
          const originalText = copyBtn.textContent
          copyBtn.textContent = '✓ 已复制'
          copyBtn.classList.remove('bg-blue-500', 'hover:bg-blue-600')
          copyBtn.classList.add('bg-green-500')
          setTimeout(() => {
            copyBtn.textContent = originalText
            copyBtn.classList.remove('bg-green-500')
            copyBtn.classList.add('bg-blue-500', 'hover:bg-blue-600')
          }, 2000)
        } catch {
          alert('复制失败，请手动复制链接')
        }
      })
    }
  })
</script>
